{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日一名61歲女子抱着孩子，在登機口附近向機坪方向拋出4枚硬幣，導致航班緊急暫停，近10名機務人員展開排查，耗時50多分鐘。<strong>最終，該女子因危害航空安全相關行為被警方依法行政拘留5日。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586752.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.836541+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:25:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_hash":"b4bb623833e911a1f19c5f5e30a19f6051b4722949d8817c00f29bf5fe6e8e2b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}